      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\naggregate_metric_stats.py - retrieves aggregated statistics for a metric over a time window\ncompare_metric_series.py - compares metric values for two resources or dimension filters over the same window\ndashboard_note_translate.py - Translate metric or dashboard notes for another locale\nfilter_metric_dimensions.py - queries metric data filtered by resource labels or dimensions\nmetric_annotation_safety.py - Check free-text metric labels or annotations for unsafe text\nmetric_summary.py - Summarize recent metric trends or anomalies\nmetrics_export_archive.py - Archive exported metric snapshots in managed object storage\nobservability_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Managed Metrics Monitoring\nobservability_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Managed Metrics Monitoring\nquery_metric_window.py - queries recent datapoints for a named metric over a time window\n\nCreate aggregate_metric_stats.py in the current working directory.\nTask: retrieves aggregated statistics for a metric over a time window.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
