      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `aggregate_metric_stats.py` that retrieves aggregated statistics for a metric over a time window, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. Given the nature of the task, a suitable provider would be AWS CloudWatch, which offers comprehensive metrics monitoring and aggregation capabilities. I will use the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with CloudWatch. </thinking>\n",
